  feedbackTexts:
    forceTooLight: Grinding force is too light, so the aroma is not fully released.
    forceTooHeavy: Grinding force is too heavy, and part of the aroma is damaged.
    forceCorrect: Grinding force is suitable, and the aroma releases steadily.
    speedTooSlow: Grinding speed is too slow, so the ingredients do not blend fully.
    speedTooFast: Grinding speed is too fast, causing uneven texture and unstable aroma release.
    speedCorrect: Grinding speed is steady, and the aroma structure is complete.
    durationTooShort: Grinding duration is too short, so the aroma has not fully opened.
    durationCorrect: Grinding duration is suitable, and the aroma release is complete.
    durationTooLong: Grinding duration is too long, and part of the aroma starts to flatten.
